<!-- Launcher foreground: the mark, the same coach every bus on the map is
     drawn as (i-coach in index.html), white with its windscreen and lamps cut
     through to the maroon and its signboard lit, over the livery's gold trim.
     The coach sits inside the adaptive icon's 66dp safe circle; the trim runs
     to the foot of the 108dp canvas, so on a squared or rounded launcher it
     reads as the band along the bottom of the web icons, and on a circle it
     is mostly cropped, as it is there. Converted from the symbol, so if the
     coach is redrawn, convert it again. tools/render-icons.sh renders the PNGs
     older Androids use from tools/app-icons.html. -->
